Package: sportsdataverse
Title: Easily Install and Load the 'SportsDataverse'
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: 
    c(person(given = "Saiem", family = "Gilani", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
             email = "saiem.gilani@gmail.com",
             comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7194-9067")))
Description: Installs and loads, in a single step, the set of 'sportsdataverse'
    sports data packages, which work in harmony because they share common
    data representations and 'API' design. Also reports and updates the
    installed versions of those packages. Learn more about the
    'sportsdataverse' at <https://sportsdataverse.org>.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/sportsdataverse/sportsdataverse-R,
    https://r.sportsdataverse.org
BugReports: https://github.com/sportsdataverse/sportsdataverse-R/issues
